flowchart TB
  source[Factory definitions / four config appliers] --> config[HOME settings and hook configuration]
  config --> event[Harness event / current session snapshot]
  event --> frontend[Four Python frontend entries]
  frontend --> core[Shared git-destroy-gate main / envelope selection]
  core --> parse[Shell segments / git tokens / destroy target]
  parse --> status[git status / cwd / pathspec / 2s]
  status -- observed changes --> deny[Parent-specific deny JSON]
  core -- off / unsupported / invalid --> noop[No output]
  parse -- no supported target --> noop
  status -- clean or observation failure --> noop
  event --> constitution[Cursor constitution hook]
  constitution -- prompt or preToolUse --> stamp{Stamp already exists?}
  constitution -- sessionStart --> read
  stamp -- yes --> noop
  stamp -- no --> read[Read factory.mdc / strip frontmatter]
  read --> context[Full or compact additional_context]
  context --> parent[Parent receives output / reading not acknowledged]
  context -- prompt or preToolUse --> save[Write per-session stamp for two events]
  save -- failure --> repeat[Next event may repeat delivery]
  read -- missing or empty --> noop
